                "content": "## Lead Capture & CRM Automation\n\n### SETUP REQUIRED:\n1. Click 'Google Sheets - Add Lead' node\n2. Select your Google Sheets credential\n3. Click the Document dropdown and select your spreadsheet\n4. Click the Sheet dropdown and select the sheet\n\n5. Click 'Airtable - Create Record' node\n6. Select your Airtable credential\n7. Click the Base dropdown and select your base\n8. Click the Table dropdown and select your table\n\n### Flow:\n1. Webhook receives lead data\n2. Validation checks required fields\n3. Processing cleans and enriches data\n4. Google Sheets stores the lead\n5. Airtable creates the record\n6. Success response sent to form",
